%N A400958 a(n) = Sum_{i=1..10^n} Moebius(i)*Moebius(i+1), where Moebius(n) = A008683(n).
%H A400958 Kaisa Matomäki, Maksym Radziwiłł and Terence Tao, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2140/ant.2015.9.2167">An averaged form of Chowla's conjecture</a>, Algebra & Number Theory, Vol. 9, No. 9 (2015), pp. 2167-2196.
